  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "天狗熱按怎治？"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b>作者：Tân Tik-Siu</b><br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh0bfDP75EBCkrNbnqE7cC75bxsDcDtfxeeK2NHeUtyrZU7ACuGv-ZgGNNy8FloWC0lPndQJdAsY8NpmzisiLRc8x6r4yWR78Llzf4k9h7Prd08gEAgcQfLQ8FErVN1iki0WS5yTt769sTX/s1600/67920075_3023684491038169_8821251596303204352_o.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"900\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh0bfDP75EBCkrNbnqE7cC75bxsDcDtfxeeK2NHeUtyrZU7ACuGv-ZgGNNy8FloWC0lPndQJdAsY8NpmzisiLRc8x6r4yWR78Llzf4k9h7Prd08gEAgcQfLQ8FErVN1iki0WS5yTt769sTX/s640/67920075_3023684491038169_8821251596303204352_o.png\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<i>Dengue Fever&nbsp;</i>台語叫做天狗熱，另外有一个khah古早ê名，號做「斷骨熱」，賴教授講伊mā m̄-bat聽--過。天狗熱ê病毒，透過埃及斑蠓kap白線斑蠓叮--人來傳染，病毒分做一般--ê kap出血--ê，一般ê天狗熱病毒無啥症頭。出血ê天狗熱有四型，若是hōo帶仝種病毒ê蠓叮--著，大部份ê人是無啥mih要緊，kan-ta干焦ē小可仔發炎niâ。所以，其實真濟人bat tio̍h過天狗熱，家己to m̄知--leh。Án-ne lán tī電視看--著，險仔khiau--去ê hit種天狗熱是按怎來--ê--leh？一般認為是去hōo帶無仝種出血型天狗熱病毒ê蠓叮--著，體內ê無仝種病毒抗體tshia̋ng-póng，tsiah ē出現嚴重ê症頭，m̄-koh詳細ê機制iáu無清楚。也就是講，若bat hōo帶出血天狗熱第一型病毒ê蠓叮--著，koh去hōo帶第二型iah是第三、第四型ê蠓叮--著，就ē出現天狗熱綜合症，像發燒、出癖、規身軀關節痠疼、想beh吐、拍寒拍熱、喙鼻出血、急性肝炎tsit寡症頭。M̄-koh tsit寡症頭，tio̍h ma-ná-lí-á iah是日本腦炎mā是ē有，iáu是ài去檢驗tsiah知影是m̄是天狗熱。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; 一般來講，天狗熱對大人來講無kài危險，有好好仔治療lóng ē好，致死率無到1 pha。Khah危險--ê是發生tī細漢囡仔，iah是身體khah lám ê大人。雖然天狗熱有預防射，m̄-koh ài khai tsiok濟錢，而且對細漢囡仔來講khah危險。像菲律賓tī 2015年，hōo囡仔注預防射，造成tsiok濟細漢囡仔注了，tio̍h天狗熱ê風險顛倒比無注--ê khah kuân，失去預防射beh預防ê意義。Khah有效ê防治辦法就是uì蠓仔落手，kā一寡積水ê所在清清--leh，hōo蠓仔無法度生湠，iah是tsuānn藥仔來thāu蠓仔。尤其埃及斑蠓主要bih tī室內，kap人類生活ê所在仝款，是對人類khah有威脅ê蠓。In lóng是tī北回歸線以南khah濟，南部ê天狗熱病情khah厚就是án-ne。另外一種白線斑蠓，主要tī室外生活，若是1500米以下ê所在lóng ē有，去外口tshit-thô就ài khah注意--leh。&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">編按：本文是8/16棲地復育台語講座－天狗熱按怎治？」 講座摘要記錄，主講者是台大獸醫系名譽教授賴秀穗。台灣蠻野心足生態協會舉辦ê「蠻野講堂」tuì 2019年3月份起kap李江却台語文教基金會合辦規劃十場有關生態環境議題ê台語講座，歡迎逐家tī逐個月第三禮拜五暗時七點到九點，同齊來「呷米共食廚房」（台北市中正區衡陽路9號3樓）擴展家己ê台語棲地（tshe-tē）！詳細資料ē-tàng看「台灣蠻野心足生態協會」FB專頁。</span></div>\n<div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"background-color: white; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>#</b></span></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>棲地復育台語講座專欄，</b></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案</b></span><b style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\">。</b></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報306期，2019年9月出刊。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">\n--------------------------------------------</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: #38761d; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: #38761d; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
